body+='''<p><strong>The saved arithmetic is generally sound.</strong> Independent recomputation found no numerical discrepancies in the retained guide example, Regrowth, Avalon, Theseus, Healing pilot01/02 replays or immune trajectories checked here. That is valuable. It does not prove the scorer measures the intended construct, that the treatment was isolated, or that a validator will reject a future broken run.</p><p><strong>The best current model evidence is a narrow Theseus feasibility result.</strong> Notes preserve seeded task procedures through turnover in six paired worlds. Notes already reach the ceiling; adding mentoring has no demonstrated task benefit. Regrowth yields an informative negative hybrid result. Avalon, most Healing evidence and immune v3 are primarily engineering instruments. Their value increases when those boundaries are prominent.</p><div class="callout"><p><strong>Recommended research direction:</strong> make controlled memory transfer and repair the first coherent program. Theseus tests inheritance; immune tests correction and collateral loss; Healing tests propagation. Use a shared lifecycle vocabulary, while preserving their different tasks and experimental units. Keep one active causal question per project.</p></div><p>The P1 findings are launch/reuse priorities, not a count of historically failed experiments. Several are demonstrated vulnerabilities in future execution. Original manifests, failures and raw outcomes remain intact; current prose corrections are explicitly dated.</p>'''
