body='''<p><strong>Do we currently spin up the same agent reliably? Partially, and inconsistently across projects.</strong> Several scripts reproduce controller initialization well. There is no single enforced contract spanning effective model configuration, actual delivered context, memory state and permissions. A declared model name, fixed seed or repeated persona does not close that gap.</p><p>An agent definition is the versioned policy and operating rules. An instance is that definition plus its mutable state inside an episode. Identical definitions may intentionally receive different private evidence. Role differences require declared role-specific definitions or versioned role parameters. A stateless model request may still participate in a persistent agent through controller-managed memory.</p><div class="flow"><div><strong>1 · Define</strong>Policy, roles, tools, memory and permitted changes.</div><div><strong>2 · Initialize</strong>Frozen world and explicit context; fresh or inherited state.</div><div><strong>3 · Verify</strong>Receipt of actual loaded configuration and access.</div><div><strong>4 · Evolve</strong>Observed messages, actions, memory changes and budgets.</div><div><strong>5 · Reconcile</strong>Terminal outcome, truth, lineage and every assigned unit.</div></div>'''
rows=[['Guide toy','Keyed RNG and fresh world dictionaries; programmed majority policies.','Synthetic observations and source IDs; no persistent external memory.','Good deterministic harness example. Validator still lacks several semantic invariants.'],['Regrowth','Fixed map; 199 decision cells plus fixed exit; shared model weights and stateless route prompts.','Paths and exact-input memoization live in per-cell controller state; model receives no persistent conversation.','Pin Qwen digest/runtime, record actual inputs; fixed Laya positions and access to Qwen bundle mechanism and resources.'],['Avalon','Deterministic scripted roles/signals/policies; real model adapter not implemented.','Role-scoped observation and 32-claim deque; ordered delivery and eviction.','Separate policy-phase RNG streams; serialize the model context before any adapter study.']]
