body='''<p><strong>First, fix execution truth.</strong> Require the verified condition-specific plan receipt at the lowest common execution boundary; resolve the actual qualified model configuration once; validate whole outputs before state mutation; reserve budgets before dispatch; write a terminal record for every assigned unit; separate publication errors from numerical outcomes. Refuse to overwrite completed historical run IDs.</p><p><strong>Then, fix experimental identity.</strong> Implement only the lifecycle fields used by the chosen study. Freeze actual prompt/context rendering and source bytes before launch. Record memory initialization, reset, ownership and truncation. Use named random streams so treatment-dependent message counts cannot silently change unrelated decisions. Browser sessions, vector databases or distributed checkpoint stores are unnecessary when the study does not use them.</p><p><strong>Then, qualify a measurable mechanism.</strong> Use exact/scripted controls to establish that damage causes loss, that a clean task is solvable, and that the primary endpoint is attainable. Distinguish broad task competence from repeated wording templates. A qualification failure should stop model efficacy comparisons, while retaining all failed evidence.</p><p><strong>Finally, run one paired held-out study.</strong> Freeze one primary contrast, experimental unit, useful effect size, cost ceiling, failure handling and analysis. Choose sample size from pilot variation and desired precision. Randomize or counterbalance role positions and order. Preserve paired worlds in analysis and treat repeated seeds, forks and downstream agents at their proper dependency level.</p>'''
body+=table(['Acceptance check','Pass condition'],[[H(a),H(b)] for a,b in [
('Wrong model/config','An altered runtime config cannot pass the qualified-spec check; requested/served identities are recorded where available.'),
('Wrong context/memory','Paired baseline receipts differ only in the declared overlay; fresh episodes cannot read prior mutable state.'),
('Invalid response','Malformed coordinator output leaves old memory intact and records contract failure; a valid wrong answer remains an ordinary scientific error.'),
('Interrupted run','Every assignment has completed/failed/canceled/not-run status and partial evidence; source hashes exist before start.'),
('Budget/provider outage','A dispatch at the exact cap is refused; one provider’s successes cannot hide another provider’s failure streak.'),
('Misleading scorer','Current-world truth and expected agent IDs are checked independently; immutable hashes alone cannot make an inconsistent trace pass.'),
('Historical publication','A new run cannot reuse a completed ID with a different manifest; report failure can be retried from saved traces.'),
('Scientific claim','One sentence states task/population, treatment/comparator, endpoint, unit, effect and limit without calling a toy a model experiment.')]])
body+='''<p><strong>Writing and aesthetics:</strong> lead every result page with its evidence class, denominator, main contrast and limit. Put baseline, effect, uncertainty and cost together. Show per-world dots for tiny samples; use visible missing slots and accessible tables for canvas replays. Keep the existing typography and responsive design. Reduce decorative biology where it obscures what was measured. Prefer “programmed memory propagation” or “stateless policy with controller memory” when that is what ran.</p><p>One protocol, three resolved specifications, a receipt, a ledger, event records and one independent analysis script are enough for the next small study. Add infrastructure only when an observed failure or scaling need requires it.</p>'''
parts.append(section('standards','A lean route to stronger research',body,'06 / Prioritized work'))
body='''<p>This review made the following bounded changes. It did <strong>not</strong> implement the open runner fixes or alter archived scientific outcomes.</p><ul><li>Authored the agent lifecycle concept and runbook, including intended versus observed configuration, context assembly, memory progression, heterogeneous roles, resets, retries, checkpoints and forks.</li><li>Added the 29-entry research supplement and structured source register, with reading depth and explicit unverified social leads.</li><li>Updated guide navigation and mandatory public-plan wording; added the current repository index.</li><li>Corrected project-card biological caption matching and rebuilt the dossier; verified all 16 labels.</li><li>Corrected current Regrowth v2 qualification prose to Qwen 5/10, Laya 6/10 with a dated editorial note; archived evidence stays unchanged.</li><li>Corrected Co-Scientist pagination to 157 total pages:42 main and 115 supplementary.</li></ul>'''
